@prefix : <https://w3id.org/laderr#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

### Shape for Entity
:Shape_Entity a sh:NodeShape ;

    sh:targetClass :Entity ;

    # Relationship with Capability
    sh:property [
        sh:path :capabilities ;
        sh:class :Capability ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:severity sh:Warning ;
        sh:message "Property 'capabilities' must reference one or more Capability instances."@en ;
    ] .
